                                                "sense_id": "a97fc1fc-b0de-3c5d-ba25-3654be39d31f",
                                                "text": "The first night, I did nothing more than have a glass of wine at Faust Wine Cellar, located under the Dominican cloister that houses the Hilton Budapest Hotel in the Buda Castle complex."
